[{"id":"fastapi-0141-callback-vs-webhook","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["OpenAPI","事件"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十四)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十四)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/f8ac9084/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十四)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十四)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/f8ac9084/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>OpenAPI callback 与 webhook 的方向有什么区别？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>callback 描述本服务向对方发出的回调请求，webhook 描述本服务接收外部事件的入口。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>callback 的 URL 通常来自客户端提交的订阅地址，Schema 描述未来出站请求的形状；webhook 是本服务公开的入站路径，接收端要自己做签名、重放和幂等校验。二者都只是契约描述，不会自动完成网络投递或安全验证，方向和责任必须在文档与测试中分别固定。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a7-term-kill","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["信号","进程"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理","articlePath":"posts/23ca1872/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理","articlePath":"posts/23ca1872/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么通常先发 SIGTERM，再考虑 SIGKILL？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>SIGTERM 给程序清理资源和保存状态的机会，SIGKILL 无法被捕获或清理。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>信号的顺序决定程序有没有机会收尾：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">pid=$(pgrep -n -f \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;sleep 60&#x27;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">ps -o pid,ppid,\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">stat\u003c/span>,cmd -p \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$pid\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">kill\u003c/span> -TERM \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$pid\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">sleep\u003c/span> 1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">kill\u003c/span> -0 \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$pid\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> 2&gt;/dev/null &amp;&amp; \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;仍在运行，才评估 SIGKILL&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>SIGTERM\u003c/code> 可以被程序捕获，常用于关闭连接、刷新状态和删除临时文件；\u003ccode>SIGKILL\u003c/code> 由内核直接终止，程序没有清理机会。两者都必须建立在已核对 PID 和命令行之上，否则“强制结束”可能命中同名的另一进程。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-DIAG-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["tcpdump","Wireshark","过滤器"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":10,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>tcpdump 捕获过滤器和 Wireshark 显示过滤器有什么区别？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>tcpdump 在采集时用 BPF 减少写入的数据，Wireshark 在已捕获数据上按协议字段筛选；两者语法和证据阶段不同。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>例如 tcpdump 使用 host/tcp port，Wireshark 使用 ip.addr/tcp.port/tcp.stream。先用宽过滤器确认包存在，再逐步收窄。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>先确认“采集阶段”还是“显示阶段”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>工具\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>过滤发生时机\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>示例\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>tcpdump\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>捕获时\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>host 198.51.100.20 and tcp port 443\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Wireshark\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>已捕获数据上\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>ip.addr == 198.51.100.20 &amp;&amp; tcp.port == 443\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>若没有包，先检查接口、命名空间、权限、捕获点和宽过滤器，再收窄条件。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-DIAG-FAQ-004","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["抓包","权限","信任库"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/"}],"articleIndex":9,"articleCount":10,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么不建议用 777 或改系统信任库做实验？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>宽权限会扩大实验副作用，系统信任库会让后续真实校验失去基线。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>临时目录、单次 \u003ccode>--cacert\u003c/code>、精确 PID 和最小权限足以完成验证，不需要修改全局安全边界。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>证据采集的最小安全闭环是：\u003c/p>\n\u003col>\n\u003cli>先限定主机、接口、时间和包数；\u003c/li>\n\u003cli>再脱敏 Cookie、Authorization、查询参数和内部地址；\u003c/li>\n\u003cli>最后只清理自己创建的文件与进程，不改变全局信任库或权限。\u003c/li>\n\u003c/ol>\n\u003cp>抓到内容只说明观察成功，不自动赋予公开或共享权限。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-L2-004","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["交换机","泛洪"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":10,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>未知单播为什么会泛洪？泛洪是否会从入端口发回？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>因为交换机暂时不知道目的 MAC 所在端口，会在同一广播域内扩散，但通常不从入端口发回。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>未知单播泛洪是学习过程的正常边界，不等于广播，也不等于帧一定会被目标主机接受。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>观察交换机时，先区分“学习”与“转发”两个动作：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>输入\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>交换机动作\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>观察结果\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>源 MAC 从端口 1 进入\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>记录 MAC → 端口 1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>FDB 新增或刷新\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>目的 MAC 已在端口 2\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查询 FDB\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>只发往端口 2\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>目的 MAC 未知\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>暂时无法定向\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>同广播域泛洪且不回入端口\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>因此主机换端口或条目老化时，短暂泛洪是动态学习的结果；要判断故障，还要看端口、VLAN 和后续是否重新学习。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-error-chain","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","异常链","raise from"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(八)异常、上下文与文件.md","articleTitle":"Python(八)异常、上下文与文件","articlePath":"posts/c31bf4bb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(八)异常、上下文与文件.md","articleTitle":"Python(八)异常、上下文与文件","articlePath":"posts/c31bf4bb/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么使用 \u003ccode>raise NewError(...) from error\u003c/code>？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它保留底层异常作为原因，同时向调用方提供更贴近领域的异常类型和消息。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>raise ... from ...\u003c/code> 同时保留底层原因和面向调用者的领域异常：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">try\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    port = \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">int\u003c/span>(raw_port)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">except\u003c/span> ValueError \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">as\u003c/span> error:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">raise\u003c/span> ConfigError(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;port 必须是整数&quot;\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">from\u003c/span> error\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>日志会显示 \u003ccode>ConfigError\u003c/code> 的业务语义，也能沿异常链追到原始 \u003ccode>ValueError\u003c/code>。只有底层细节无关或不应公开时才使用 \u003ccode>from None\u003c/code>；不要为了“看起来简洁”丢掉排障所需的 cause。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-advanced-slots","type":"basic","priority":3,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","__slots__","内存","对象模型"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Python(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/a99f76bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Python(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/a99f76bc/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>__slots__\u003c/code> 的收益和代价是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它可限制实例属性并可能降低大量实例的内存开销，但会影响动态属性、继承、弱引用和工具兼容性。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>__slots__\u003c/code> 用固定描述符代替默认实例字典，可能减少大量同构实例的内存开销，但也缩小了对象的动态能力：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">class\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title class_\">Point\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    __slots__ = (\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;x&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;y&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">__init__\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">self, x, y\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>.x, \u003cspan class=\"variable language_\">self\u003c/span>.y = x, y\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">point = Point(\u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">point.z = \u003cspan class=\"number\">3\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># AttributeError：没有动态属性槽\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>使用前后应测量真实内存，并测试序列化、继承、弱引用和调试工具的兼容性。它不是默认风格；数据类的 \u003ccode>slots=True\u003c/code> 也要接受相同边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a13-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["并发","性能","功能"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十三)非功能测试补充.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十三)非功能测试补充","articlePath":"posts/69978da/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十三)非功能测试补充.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十三)非功能测试补充","articlePath":"posts/69978da/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>并发功能测试与性能测试有什么区别？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>并发功能测试验证并发条件下的业务结果和不变量；性能测试验证负载下的延迟、吞吐、资源和容量指标。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>两个用户同时领取最后一份库存时，目标是只有一个成功且库存不为负，这是功能正确性；逐步增加并发并测 p95 延迟和错误率，是性能目标。工具和执行方式可能相同，但预期、指标和结论不同。报告应分开写，不能用“压测通过”代替业务一致性证据。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>维度\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>并发功能\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>性能负载\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>主要问题\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>结果、顺序、库存等业务不变量\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>延迟、吞吐、错误率和资源\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>典型证据\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>两个请求的状态、记录数和幂等键\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>p50/p95/p99、采样窗口和负载模型\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>结论边界\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不能推出容量或长稳达标\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不能推出每个业务规则正确\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]